    WallTexturePromptHint: Seamless warm archive wall material with carved stone
      or aged plaster panels, faint gold linework, and quiet scholarly atmosphere.
    FloorTexturePromptHint: Seamless worn stone or dark wood study-room floor material
      with subtle inlaid arcane geometry, readable paths, and low visual noise.
    CeilingTreatmentPromptHint: Warm candlelit overhead treatment with muted plaster,
      soft ornament rings, and ambient library-chamber mood without obscuring real
      boundaries.
  Mood:
    MainLightColor: {r: 1, g: 0.84, b: 0.65, a: 1}
    MainLightIntensity: 0.92
    AmbientSkyColor: {r: 0.31, g: 0.2, b: 0.12, a: 1}
