  DefaultTableProxy: {fileID: 0}
  DefaultSeatProxy: {fileID: 0}
  DefaultStorageProxy: {fileID: 0}
  DefaultScreenTreatmentPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  PreserveCollisionSensitiveFootprints: 1
  ReplacementRules:
  - SemanticLabel: wall
    FunctionTag: boundary
    Mode: 1
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 0
    ReplicaName: carved archive chamber wall
    ReplicaFunction: boundary
    AppearancePrompt: Warm carved stone or aged plaster wall treatment with faint
      gold inlay lines, scholarly ornament, candlelit amber tones, and low visual
      noise. Preserve the real wall plane and room boundary readability.
    Notes: Layer walls with warm archive surfaces instead of new geometry.
  - SemanticLabel: floor
    FunctionTag: boundary
    Mode: 1
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 0
    ReplicaName: inlaid archive stone floor
    ReplicaFunction: walkable boundary
    AppearancePrompt: Worn stone or dark wood study-room floor with subtle inlaid
      arcane geometry, muted amber highlights, and clearly readable walking paths.
      Keep the surface flat and unobtrusive.
    Notes: Use floor treatment only, no path changes.
  - SemanticLabel: table
    FunctionTag: support_surface
    Mode: 2
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 1
    ReplicaName: arcane reading altar table
    ReplicaFunction: support_surface for reading and collaborative study
    AppearancePrompt: A rectangular reading altar table with dark polished wood,
      brass corner guards, carved rune-like border inlays, sturdy legs, and warm
      amber accent glow. Preserve the real table footprint, tabletop height, long-axis
      orientation, and support-surface role.
    Notes: Convert tables into reading altars without moving them.
  - SemanticLabel: screen
    FunctionTag: display_surface
    Mode: 3
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 0
    ReplicaName: illuminated manuscript display
    ReplicaFunction: display_surface
    AppearancePrompt: A wall-aligned illuminated manuscript display with warm
      parchment glow, thin brass edging, subtle glyph annotations, and a readable
      board-like surface. Do not add bulky geometry.
    Notes: Displays become illuminated manuscript surfaces.
  - SemanticLabel: storage
    FunctionTag: storage
    Mode: 2
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 1
    ReplicaName: archive cabinet shelving
    ReplicaFunction: storage
    AppearancePrompt: Dark wood archive cabinets and shelves with brass fittings,
      labelled drawers, scroll compartments, and warm amber edge highlights. Preserve
      original storage volume and collision boundaries.
    Notes: Storage reads as archive cabinets and shelves.
  - SemanticLabel: seat
    FunctionTag: seating
    Mode: 2
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 1
    ReplicaName: scholarly chamber seat
    ReplicaFunction: seating
    AppearancePrompt: A scholarly reading seat with dark carved wood, muted leather
      or velvet cushions, brass accents, and a clear sit-able silhouette. Preserve
      footprint and facing direction.
    Notes: Seating remains legible and safe.
